Package: ai-reader
Version: 1.0.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: AI Reader Team <dev@ai-reader.io>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0, libgtk-3-0, libc6, libstdc++6
Homepage: https://github.com/ai-reader/ai-reader
Description: Minimalist Cross-Platform AI Reader with NLP Knowledge Graph and MindMap
 AI Reader is a Typora-style distraction-free reading application supporting EPUB,
 PDF, Markdown, and TXT with offline classical NLP keyword extraction, co-occurrence
 knowledge graphs, mind maps, and decoupled contextual AI annotations.
